title: "PHI-CTRL: Physics-Hybrid Integrity Control for Fault-Tolerant Flight"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bello
    given-names: Mohammed Sani
    alias: S. M. Bello
    website: "https://smbello.vercel.app"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sm-bello/PHI-CTRL"
url: "https://penelope-inc.vercel.app"
abstract: >-
  Hybrid integrity architecture for resilient longitudinal control under
  elevator-effectiveness faults on JSBSim F-16A (6-DOF). Baseline energy-hold,
  MRAC, MMAE effectiveness bank, optional residual policy, diagnostic observer.
  Simulation and optional FlightGear path. No flight claims.
keywords:
  - flight-control
  - fault-tolerance
  - jsbsim
  - digital-twin
  - phm
  - mrac
  - adaptive-control
